  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\n**Given:** 17 - 8 × 2 + 6 ÷ 4 = 7\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 6 and 8\n\n17 - 8 × 2 + 6 ÷ 4 = 7 ⇒ 17 - 6 × 2 + 8 ÷ 4 = 7\n\n⇒ 17 - 6 × 2 + __**8 ÷ 4**__ = 7\n\n⇒ 17 - __**6 × 2**__ + 8 ÷ 4 = 7\n\n⇒ __**17 + 2**__ - 12 = 7\n\n⇒ __**19 - 12**__ = 7\n\n**⇒ 7 = 7 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) 4 and 7\n\n17 - 8 × 2 + 6 ÷ 4 = 7 ⇒ 17 - 8 × 2 + 6 ÷ 7 = 4\n\n⇒ 17 - 8 × 2 + __**6 ÷ 7**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 17 - __**8 × 2**__ + 0.85 = 4\n\n⇒ __**17 + 0.85**__ - 16 = 4\n\n⇒ __17.85** - 16**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 1.85 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 2 and 4\n\n17 - 8 × 2 + 6 ÷ 4 = 7 ⇒ 17 - 8 × 4 + 6 ÷ 2 = 7\n\n⇒ 17 - 8 × 4 + __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 7\n\n⇒ 17 - __**8 × 4**__ + 3 = 7\n\n⇒ __**17 + 3**__ - 32 = 7\n\n⇒ __20** - 32**__ = 7\n\n⇒ -12 ≠ 7 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 17 and 7\n\n17 - 8 × 2 + 6 ÷ 4 = 7 ⇒ 7 - 8 × 2 + 6 ÷ 4 = 17\n\n⇒ 7 - 8 × 2 + __**6 ÷ 4**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 7 - __**8 × 2**__ + 1.5 = 17\n\n⇒ __**7 + 1.5**__ - 16 = 17\n\n⇒ __8.5** - 16**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 7.5 ≠ 17 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
